    ["<Assistant_Title1>【六只鸽子】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>廷根街头有个疯疯癫癫的老太太，总是说绅士的帽子里有鸽子……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>晋升至序列7，前往{Location:[廷根(890,775)]|-11029;-22567;-1284;2;5200002;0}处，与<Assistant_Red>老妇人</>对话接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、世界冒险秘宝进度、冒险勋章、发票单据"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Six Pigeons】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>There is a crazy old lady on the streets of Tingen who always says there are pigeons in a gentleman's hat...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Advance to Sequence 7, go to {Location:[Tingen(890,775)]|-11029;-22567;-1284;2;5200002;0}, and speak with the <Assistant_Red>Old Woman</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medal, Invoices",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【未邀之诗】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>城市漫游</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>草坪上，一群年轻学生围成一圈激烈地讨论着什么。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(1532,928)]|53260;-7200;-1370;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Uninvited Poem】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>City Roaming</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </>On the lawn, a group of young students are gathered in a circle, discussing something intensely.\n<Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </>After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(1532,928)]|53260;-7200;-1370;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n您所在的俱乐部<M_Orange>%s</>已经连续<M_Orange>%s</>天处于低活跃状态，由于议事厅等级已于上周降至<M_Orange>%s</>级，俱乐部被解散。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\nThe Club <M_Orange>%s</> you belong to has been in a state of low activity for <M_Orange>%s</> consecutive days. Since the Council Hall level dropped to <M_Orange>%s</> last week, the Club has been disbanded.",
    ["<P_Heart>（先稳住它再说。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Let's stabilize it first.)</>",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>非凡天赋系统</>\n1.每名非凡者有两种不同的非凡天赋方向，每个方向包含<Highlight>基础天赋节点</>和<Highlight>特殊天赋节点</>。\n2.使用<Highlight>天赋点</>升级天赋节点，<Highlight>天赋点</>通过<Highlight>序列晋升</>获得。\n3.升级<Highlight>基础天赋节点</>，能够获得更强的力量。部分<Highlight>基础天赋节点</>升级后，可以解锁<Highlight>特殊天赋节点</>。\n4.<Highlight>特殊天赋节点</>通常蕴含着特殊的非凡能力，升级后会使自身的某些能力获得强化或改变。\n5.<Highlight>天赋点</>可以同时给两个非凡天赋方向加点，非凡者能够同时在两个方向上强化不同的<Highlight>天赋节点</>。但同一时间内只能激活一个方向，让其发挥作用。\n6.部分<Highlight>基础天赋节点</>的升级受到<Highlight>序列等级</>的限制。但非凡者可以随时重置任意天赋节点，体验不同的强化效果。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Beyonder Talent System </> \n 1. Each Beyonder has two different Beyonder talent directions, each containing <Highlight> Basic Talent Nodes </> and <Highlight> Special Talent Nodes </>. \n 2. Use <Highlight> Talent Points </> to upgrade talent nodes; <Highlight> Talent Points </> are obtained through <Highlight> Sequence advancement </>. \n 3. Upgrading <Highlight> Basic Talent Nodes </> grants stronger power. After upgrading certain <Highlight> Basic Talent Nodes </>, you can unlock <Highlight> Special Talent Nodes </>. \n 4. <Highlight> Special Talent Nodes </> usually contain special Beyonder abilities; upgrading them will strengthen or change certain abilities of your own. \n 5. <Highlight> Talent Points </> can be used to add points to both Beyonder talent directions simultaneously, allowing a Beyonder to strengthen different <Highlight> Talent Nodes </> in both directions at the same time. However, only one direction can be activated at a time to take effect. \n 6. The upgrade of some <Highlight> Basic Talent Nodes </> is restricted by the <Highlight> Sequence level </>. However, Beyonders can reset any talent node at any time to experience different strengthening effects.",
